    "detailed_description": "<h1>A CINEMATIC SPACE SHOOTER - WISHLIST NOW!</h1><p><br></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/c14b3d1fdd524a87fb0f02e023b2631d.avif?t=1714954899\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Features of the game: <br></li><li>You have to jump a lot <br></li><li>Shoot your opponents a lot <br></li><li>Lifting in up <br></li><li>Below you will find red hot spikes moving up <br></li><li>It's raining on the level </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.poster.avif?t=1714954899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.webm?t=1714954899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.mp4?t=1714954899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br>The main character is a frog that can jump, shoot and teleport! Who is the main enemy of the frog? Perch, yes perch! But the perch cannot come to the surface. Dangerous mechanical robots under the control of a perch are placed on the level, and a special danger is coming from below!",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/c14b3d1fdd524a87fb0f02e023b2631d.avif?t=1714954899\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Features of the game: <br></li><li>You have to jump a lot <br></li><li>Shoot your opponents a lot <br></li><li>Lifting in up <br></li><li>Below you will find red hot spikes moving up <br></li><li>It's raining on the level </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.poster.avif?t=1714954899\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.webm?t=1714954899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1564950/extras/869844b639e5de3351af6b7eb9aedb35.mp4?t=1714954899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br> <br>The main character is a frog that can jump, shoot and teleport! Who is the main enemy of the frog? Perch, yes perch! But the perch cannot come to the surface. Dangerous mechanical robots under the control of a perch are placed on the level, and a special danger is coming from below!",
